{"id":"5eb3411eede37b39","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-veltman-frame.md","title":"Veltman框架与Montagna框架条件","display":"df-veltman-frame — Veltman框架与Montagna框架条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-veltman-frame","aliases":["72-df-veltman-frame"],"display":"df-veltman-frame — Veltman框架与Montagna框架条件","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII Definitions13.3 and13.5, print515/PDF527","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-veltman-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-veltman-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-veltman-frame — Veltman框架与Montagna框架条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII Definitions13.3 and13.5, print515/PDF527"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W^2\">\\(R\\subseteq W^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:W\\to\\mathcal P(W^2)\">\\(S:W\\to\\mathcal P(W^2)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,u,v,z\\in W\">\\(w,u,v,z\\in W\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLFrame}\">\\(\\operatorname{GLFrame}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R[w]\">\\(R[w]\\)</span> 与中缀记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uS(w)v\">\\(uS(w)v\\)</span> 均由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R[w]:=\\{u\\in W:\\langle w,u\\rangle\\in R\\},\\qquad\nuS(w)v\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\langle u,v\\rangle\\in S(w).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R[w]:=\\{u\\in W:\\langle w,u\\rangle\\in R\\},\\qquad\nuS(w)v\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\langle u,v\\rangle\\in S(w).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S):\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\land S\\in\\mathcal P(W^2)^W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\ \\bigl[S(w)\\subseteq R[w]^2\\land\n\\forall u\\in R[w]\\ (uS(w)u)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v,z\\in R[w]\\ (uS(w)v\\land vS(w)z\\Rightarrow uS(w)z)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v\\in R[w]\\ (R(u,v)\\Rightarrow uS(w)v)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S):\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\land\n\\forall w,u,v,z\\in W\\ (uS(w)v\\land R(v,z)\\Rightarrow R(u,z)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S):\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\land S\\in\\mathcal P(W^2)^W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in W\\ \\bigl[S(w)\\subseteq R[w]^2\\land\n\\forall u\\in R[w]\\ (uS(w)u)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v,z\\in R[w]\\ (uS(w)v\\land vS(w)z\\Rightarrow uS(w)z)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v\\in R[w]\\ (R(u,v)\\Rightarrow uS(w)v)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S):\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\land\n\\forall w,u,v,z\\in W\\ (uS(w)v\\land R(v,z)\\Rightarrow R(u,z)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>uS(w)v 缩写有序对属于 S(w)。每个 S(w) 只在 w 的严格后继上反身、传递；不能误读为整个 W 上的反身关系。MF 的最后条件正是原书 (iv)，方向从目标 v 的 R 后继回到源 u 的 R 后继。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W\\ne\\varnothing$ 为集合，$R\\subseteq W^2$，$S:W\\to\\mathcal P(W^2)$；$w,u,v,z\\in W$。$\\operatorname{GLFrame}$ 取 [[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]。$R[w]$ 与中缀记号 $uS(w)v$ 均由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"W\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq W^2","display":false},{"tex":"S:W\\to\\mathcal P(W^2)","display":false},{"tex":"w,u,v,z\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"R[w]","display":false},{"tex":"uS(w)v","display":false},{"tex":"R[w]:=\\{u\\in W:\\langle w,u\\rangle\\in R\\},\\qquad\nuS(w)v\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\langle u,v\\rangle\\in S(w).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S):\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\land S\\in\\mathcal P(W^2)^W\\\\\n&\\land\\forall w\\in W\\ \\bigl[S(w)\\subseteq R[w]^2\\land\n\\forall u\\in R[w]\\ (uS(w)u)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v,z\\in R[w]\\ (uS(w)v\\land vS(w)z\\Rightarrow uS(w)z)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v\\in R[w]\\ (R(u,v)\\Rightarrow uS(w)v)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S):\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\land\n\\forall w,u,v,z\\in W\\ (uS(w)v\\land R(v,z)\\Rightarrow R(u,z)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1806,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"f0c9e30e2bea53f4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"3e82291b3e069169","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"}],"outgoing":["91aa38d1fd431425"]}